    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't Fall \u2013 A Game of Balance and Timing</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stack it. Balance it. Survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Don't Fall</i> is a fast-paced strategy and simulation game where you place objects of various sizes on a wooden shelf and fight against gravity. Your goal? Don\u2019t let anything fall. With each object added, balance becomes harder to maintain \u2014 and time is always ticking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some items come with unique effects, appearing at low probability to turn the tide or test your skill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple to play, hard to master.<br>Can you keep it steady until the timer runs out?</p>",
